# Free Unsplash API key — get one at https://unsplash.com/developers
# 1. Sign up / log in, click "New Application"
# 2. Accept the terms, name it anything (e.g. "Anti Furniture Demo")
# 3. Copy the "Access Key" shown on the app page
# 4. Copy this file to .env and paste the key below
VITE_UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_key_here
